From a7a1a31d7fd1649ff9c750911080176d5fd107e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:49:58 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] panvk: select viewports for VS and TES ViewportIndex writes
 biblioklept

A VS or TES that writes ViewportIndex now draws through the gpu_prerast
passthrough, which applies the selected viewport transform and writes
per-viewport scissor planes. The draw is split into ordered viewport
runs (libpan vp_runs.cl, now instance aware) so each run gets that
viewport's hardware depth clamp. Tess-fed draws replay the run list
per chunk. Allocate the gpu_prerast arena when shaderOutputViewportIndex
is enabled and advertise the feature on v10+. v12 keeps the passthrough
without run splitting.

Generated-by: LLM
